      "party": "Democratic Party",
      "incumbent": true,
      "summary": "Sara Jacobs is the incumbent U.S. Representative for California's 51st Congressional District, first elected in 2020 and currently serving her third term. She serves on the House Foreign Affairs Committee (Ranking Member of the Subcommittee on Africa) and the House Armed Services Committee, and is the youngest member of California's congressional delegation. Jacobs previously worked at the United Nations, UNICEF, the U.S. Department of State, and as a foreign policy advisor on Hillary Clinton's 2016 presidential campaign.",
